2. Implicit Q-Learning (IQL) — MIT
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is built on the reference implementation of "Offline
Reinforcement Learning with Implicit Q-Learning" by Ilya Kostrikov, Ashvin Nair
and Sergey Levine (https://github.com/ikostrikov/implicit_q_learning),
copyright (c) 2021 Ilya Kostrikov, Ashvin Nair, Sergey Levine, licensed under
the MIT Licence. The full notice is preserved in LICENSE.iql.

Files derived from that work, modified here:
  actor.py, common.py, critic.py, dataset_utils.py, evaluation.py, learner.py,
  policy.py, value_net.py, train_offline.py, configs/, wrappers/

